gets a path that the transports do not write, so the SDK lane's transcript evidence cannot be collected.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-    const agentSessionId = (await readFile(join(workspace, CLI_SESSION_FILE), 'utf8')).trim();\n+    const agentSessionId = (await readFile(join(scratchDir, 'agent-sessions', `${verdict.sessionId}${CLI_SESSION_FILE}`), 'utf8')).trim();\n```\n\n</details>","id":"079912bea2df3db9915c2b12f3dc10cc1240d4fd35f5c3c18407ffc1327922fc","intervals":[],"path":"scripts/dd1-abort-spike.mjs","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Read the SDK session sidecar from the session store, not the workspace."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"0c0c25c34c9e7f4e0710dc98c4a844e455859086","body":"**Reject missing paths that are not deletions.**\n\nIf an owned-file argument contains a typo, `ownedFiles()` drops it as a deletion. When all arguments are misspelled, `scripts/fix.mjs` and `scripts/lint-fast.mjs` report nothing to process and exit successfully. Check that a missing path was actually deleted; reject other missing paths.","id":"71dfee7fa42c7f5ca9ddce55b8312030e6d3c879748491f57f0e95c1a73c7eb8","intervals":[],"path":"scripts/lib/owned-files.mjs","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Reject missing paths that are not deletions."}],"head":"bbf04ee2ac9b16640040a38e3e8535ad3281d42c","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520f2358e9d1367a3d73c21ab4fb44","input_scope":[{"blob":"d240702b23127c90025a938e486cc510d9fc975a","intervals":[[16,16],[19,19],[49,49],[51,51],[55,62],[109,111],[123,126],[152,155],[171,171],[178,179],[190,190],[193,193],[199,201],[203,203],[259,259],[262,266],[285,285],[290,296],[335,335],[361,362],[365,366],[377,377],[381,383],[386,388],[398,399],[427,428],[446,448],[460,462]],"path":"scripts/dd1-abort-spike.mjs"},{"blob":"9f6d61842ecfc22339e86ad90ee8b955639bb2df","intervals":[[1,25]],"path":"scripts/fix.mjs"},{"blob":"7f3cb8447fe49e8e4202b7ea70b6fe70098e8327","int